---
// Angebots-Karte V02 — ohne Bild (auf User-Wunsch erstmal weg)
// Quelle: hsc-website/03-Inhalte/01-Startseite-Texte-V01.md (Sektion B)
import type { Offer } from '../data/offers';
interface Props {
  offer: Offer;
  background?: 'cream' | 'white';
}
const { offer, background = 'white' } = Astro.props;
const bgClass = background === 'cream' ? 'bg-cream' : 'bg-white';
---

<section class={`offer-row ${bgClass}`}>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="offer-card reveal-on-scroll">
      <span class="card-eyebrow">{offer.eyebrow}</span>
      <h3>{offer.headline}</h3>
      <p class="promise">{offer.promise}</p>

      <ul class="bullets">
        {offer.bullets.map((b) => <li>{b}</li>)}
      </ul>

      <div class="meta">
        <span class="format">{offer.format}</span>
        <span class="price">{offer.priceFrom}</span>
      </div>

      {offer.tiers && (
        <div class="tiers">
          {offer.tiers.map((t) => (
            <div class="tier">
              <strong>{t.name}</strong>
              <span>{t.price}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      )}

      <div class="offer-cta">
        <a href={offer.ctaUrl} class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          {offer.ctaText}
        </a>
      </div>

      {offer.note && <p class="note">{offer.note}</p>}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .offer-row {
    padding: clamp(60px, 8vw, 100px) 0;
  }
  .bg-white { background: var(--bg-white); }
  .bg-cream { background: var(--bg-cream); }

  .offer-card {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .card-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--orange);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .card-eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    width: 28px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--orange);
  }

  .offer-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 2.4vw, 34px);
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--blue-deep);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }
  .promise {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 1.5vw, 21px);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }
  .bullets {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .bullets li {
    padding-left: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .bullets li::before {
    content: "—";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--orange);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(250, 157, 86, 0.3);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(250, 157, 86, 0.3);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--ink-light);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .meta .format { font-style: italic; }
  .meta .price {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--blue-deep);
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .tiers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .tier {
    background: var(--bg-cream-deeper);
    border-radius: var(--radius-button);
    padding: 12px 14px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .tier strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--blue-deep);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .tier span {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .offer-cta { margin-top: 6px; }
  .note {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--ink-light);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
  }
</style>
